Position 7 & 8 are Engine Net Brake Horsepower:
65 - 99 = 65 HP - 99 HP;
00 - 64 = 100 HP - 164 HP; 
6F - 6J = 165 HP - 169 HP;
7A - 7J = 170 HP - 179 HP;
8A - 8F = 180 HP - 185 HP;

For horsepower rating over 99, the first character shall be letter representing the hundreds of horsepower and the second character shall represent the tens of horsepower's over that, rounded off; 
A1= 110 horsepower
B3= 230 horsepower, etc..

